\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Indonesia Gov: Ctrl Bk Not Behind Recent Rupiah Rise  \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Dezember 2005\par 09:02\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to help the rupiah's recent surge against the U.S. dollar, Bank Indonesia Governor Burhanuddin Abdullah said Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been boosting the rupiah's value and the unit's future movements depend on investor sentiment," Burhanuddin told reporters. "The market will determine (the rupiah's value)."  \par \par \uc2 The comments follow the rupiah's 3% rise against the dollar last week. On Friday, the dollar closed at IDR9,695, its lowest close since June 27.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was at IDR9,730 at 0727 GMT Monday, down from an intraday high of IDR9,791  \par \par \uc2 Dealers attribute the rupiah's strength to buoyant sentiment linked to President Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono's reshuffling of his economic team last week, and to dollar sales by investors to take advantage of higher domestic interest rates.  \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia has hiked its benchmark rate 175 basis points to 12.75% since Nov. 1 to cool inflation, which hit an annualized rate of 18.38% in November and 17.89% in October.  \par \par \uc2 The soaring inflation has been blamed on the government's raising fuel prices by more than double, on average, on Oct. 1.  \par \par \uc2 The higher interest rates have made rupiah-denominated investments, such as short-term fixed deposits, more attractive.  \par \par \uc2 But analysts warn that the rupiah's sudden strength exposes the volatility and lack of liquidity in Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah's dramatic rise is "symptomatic of a dysfunctional \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that lacks liquidity and exacerbates volatility," JP Morgan said in a research note issued Monday.  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah "could just as easily swing violently back against the U.S. dollar due to the lack of liquidity," JP Morgan said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Jakarta Bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; dj.jakarta@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Paul Baylis [ 12-12-05 0802GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020051212e1cc000ar\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
