\par\par \b \uc2 Bk Indonesia Raises Benchmark Rate 75 BPs To Help IDR -2-  \b0\par\par\uc2 604 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 2005\par 09:39\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 The nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also further hiked its one-week deposit rate by 100 basis points to 8.5% effective Wednesday. Bank Indonesia last week raised the rate by 25 basis points to 7.5%.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the maximum rate for one-month guaranteed deposits to 10% for September from 8.45% currently and the one-month dollar deposit rate to 4.25% from 3%.  \par \par \uc2 The rate hikes are a follow-up to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's increase earlier this month of the benchmark Bank Indonesia rate to 8.75% from 8.50%.  \par \par \uc2 The benchmark rate hike reflects the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's increasingly desperate efforts to stem an 11% surge in the U.S. dollar against the rupiah since January that has stymied all of Bank Indonesia's policy remedies to date.  \par \par \uc2 Those remedies have included repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars in the market, which have bled \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves of more than $5 billion since April.  \par \par \uc2 The policy package is also a decisive response to heightening criticism from analysts that lax \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  monetary policy contributed to the rupiah's tumble.  \par \par \uc2 Analysts have called for aggressive interest rate hikes, cuts in budget-crippling fuel price subsidies and the removal of bureaucratic blockages to foreign investment inflows to provide meaningful relief for the rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Yudhoyono's government have been reluctant to raise interest rates too steeply or to cut fuel price subsidies due to fears that such measures could dampen economic growth and encourage public protests. The official economic growth projection for 2005 is 6.0%.  \par \par \uc2 Burhanuddin said commercial banks will also be required to increase their reserves with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with the additional amount to be tied to the ratio of their loans to deposits. This move is aimed at tightening market liquidity, he said.  \par \par \uc2 However, banks that have lent more than 90% of the deposits they received are exempt from the new policy.  \par \par \uc2 Banks with loan-to-deposit ratios between 75% and 90% must increase their reserves by 1%. Those with LDR of 60%-75% must increase their reserves by 2%; banks with LDR of 50%-60% must increase reserves by 3%; those with LDR of 40%-50% must up reserves by 4%; and those with LDR of less than 40% must increase reserves by 5%.  \par \par \uc2 Burhanuddin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will increase the returns given for the reserves of those banks with the 5% requirement to 5.5% from the current 3%.  \par \par \uc2 He said Bank Indonesia is also drafting additional measures to help the rupiah, which it will unveil in the near future.  \par \par \uc2 The measures will include providing swap facilities for companies that need to hedge their dollar exposure and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market via short-term swap instruments.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will also adjust the maximum amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  net open positions that banks can have and tighten rules on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  margin trading, he said.  \par \par \uc2 Lastly, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will intensify its monitoring of banks' \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, which are not based on underlying transactions.  \par \par \uc2 "With those measures, Bank Indonesia hopes that banks and society will support the efforts to create stability in the economy," Burhanuddin said.  \par \par \uc2 President Yudhoyono said later Tuesday in a televised speech that the government supports Bank Indonesia's rupiah package, adding that the government will introduce comprehensive measures to help the rupiah by Wednesday afternoon.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 30-08-05 0739GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050830e18u000gw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
