\par\par \b \uc2 Bank Indonesia Sells USD To Aid IDR At IDR10,075-Dealers  \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 August 2005\par 05:11\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday to slow the rupiah's slide against the U.S. dollar after a fresh 41-month low of IDR10,075 at around O300 GMT, dealers told Dow Jones Newswires.  \par \par \uc2 But they said the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  wasn't helping much to calm a jittery market intent on selling rupiah to buy dollars.  \par \par \uc2 "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...but it's failing to help the rupiah rebound because of demand from both foreign and local companies for dollars," a dealer at a foreign bank in Jakarta said.  \par \par \uc2 Corporate dollar purchases were aimed to both service overseas debt as well as to hedge in case the rupiah continues to tumble against the greenback.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers were split on whether the rupiah will slide to below the IDR10,100 mark on Tuesday, but said that the unit will continue to lose traction against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the short-term.  \par \par \uc2 The Indonesian rupiah closed at IDR10,030 Monday versus IDR10,000 Friday as foreign investors exited the stock market on worries over the recent weakness of the local unit.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's government and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  have blamed the rupiah's weakness on external factors including record high global crude oil prices and a rising trend in U.S. Federal Reserve rates.  \par \par \uc2 -By Jakarta Bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Costas Paris [ 23-08-05 0337GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050823e18n00039\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
