\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Indonesia rupiah down, policy measures fail to help  \b0\par\par\uc2 524 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 August 2005\par 04:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, Aug 23 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah slipped to a fresh 3-1/2-year trough on Tuesday, undermined by dollar demand from oil importers and a feeling among traders that authorities are not doing enough to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah <IDR=> hit 10,055 per dollar, traders said, extending its decline this month to nearly 3 percent.  \par \par \uc2 Traders said Bank Indonesia (BI) had been selling dollars through state-run banks between 10,030 and 10,050.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia's stock market <.JKSE> was also weak, with both \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and shares bucking the stronger trend in other parts of Asia.  \par \par \uc2 "The issue for Indonesia is clearly that of too little, too late," said Wong Keng Siong, economist with Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi.  \par \par \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  verbally and physically in the markets this month.  \par \par \uc2 It raised the benchmark rate on one-month paper by a quarter point on August 9 to 8.75 percent, and has been offering short-term deposits to absorb funds, so that the onshore market will find it more expensive to sell the rupiah short.  \par \par \uc2 On Monday, Bank Indonesia scrapped a repurchase facility that allowed banks to borrow funds against bonds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "Interest rates need to go up, but not at that kind of snail's pace," Wong said.  \par \par \uc2 With annual inflation running close to 8 percent, the benchmark rate should have been raised much earlier and to at least 10.5 percent to provide a decent real return on Indonesian assets, he said.  \par \par \uc2 "Higher oil prices have been partly responsible for the deterioration in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but rising domestic inflation and low real rates of return on Indonesian deposits have been more important," analysts at UBS wrote.  \par \par \uc2 OIL SUBSIDY  \par \par \uc2 Analysts said another option for Indonesia would be to cut government subsidies on domestic fuel, lowering consumption and import demand for expensive oil.  \par \par \uc2 Global oil prices <CLV5> were near $66 a barrel on Tuesday, just off record highs over $67.  \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia said in early July that state-oil-firm Pertamina will receive dollars to pay for its oil imports from the government's account with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the oil firm has been spotted buying dollars in the market.  \par \par \uc2 "The best hope for the rupiah is lower oil prices because interest rates are not going up nearly fast enough," ING's head of research, Tim Condon, wrote.  \par \par \uc2 Wong said the government's inaction on subsidies and reluctance to raise rates aggressively would weigh on the rupiah, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's $32.5 billion foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were insufficient to fight any major speculative attack.  \par \par \uc2 "We think that BI will ultimately be forced to lift rates much more aggressively in order to prevent much further weakness in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  but will likely only do so grudgingly," UBS said.  \par \par \uc2 "The implications are that the rupiah is likely to continue steadily weakening in the short-term, punctuated by sporadic \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-ASIA-RUPIAH (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|IF|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050823e18n0004j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
