\par\par \b \uc2 Bk Indonesia Dep Gov: Dlr Selling "Effective" For IDR  \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 2005\par 06:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's U.S. dollar sales to help recoup a weakening rupiah have been effective so far, Bank Indonesia Deputy Governor Aslim Tajuddin said Friday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's efforts won't pose an immediate threat to the country's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, Aslim told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 "I think Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still effective in (reducing) the rupiah's volatility," he said.  \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at $32 billion are still safe and shouldn't cause any (undue) concern."  \par \par \uc2 Indonesia can increase its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by increasing exports and limiting imports to strictly "necessary" products," he said without elaborating.  \par \par \uc2 Aslim's comments were in reference to statements by Coordinating Minister for the Economy, Aburizal Bakrie, who had said earlier that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  provided only "temporary" relief in stemming the rupiah's slide.  \par \par \uc2 Friday, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to sell dollars when the greenback rose to IDR9,980 to guard what dealers say is a crucial "psychological threshold" of IDR,10,000.  \par \par \uc2 At 0415 GMT, the dollar was at IDR9,990, making it likely that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market for the remainder of the day.  \par \par \uc2 -By Jakarta Bureau; Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; dj.jakarta@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Ven Ram [ 19-08-05 0435GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050819e18j0002x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
