\par\par \b \uc2 Indonesia Rupiah Ends At New 41-Mo Low   \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 2005\par 12:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah closed at a new 41-month low against the U.S. dollar Thursday as high oil prices continued to hurt sentiment in the local unit, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 Capital outflows from the local stock market, and dollar purchases by local companies hedging their dollar exposure accelerated the rupiah fall, dealers said.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at IDR9,950, versus its close Tuesday at IDR9,920. The market was closed Wednesday because of a national holiday.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar touched an intraday high of IDR9.975 early on, but suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the local unit recoup some of its losses.   \par \par \uc2 "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  reduced the dollar's gains, but its upward trend remains intact," a dealer with a local bank said. "Many people in the market predict the dollar will rise to IDR10,000 in the near future as local companies are expected to continue buying dollars to hedge their offshore debts."   \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia's Deputy Governor Aslim Tadjudin told Dow Jones Newswires Thursday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stands ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary to defend the rupiah.   \par \par \uc2 He said that he hopes the dollar won't rise to the psychologically-important level of IDR10,000.   \par \par \uc2 But, dealers think the dollar may test IDR10,000 Friday due to the 1.2% fall in the Indonesian stock market Thursday, and the dollar's rise against major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The support for the dollar is expected at IDR9,940 Friday.   \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 3983 1277; I-Made.Sentanadowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Costas Paris [ 18-08-05 1016GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 1159 1848   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050818e18i000gc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
