nuing domestic corporate demand for dollars will weigh on the rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar will likely trade between IDR9,770 to IDR9,800 on Monday, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 - By Phelim Kyne; Dow Jones Newswires' Jakarta Bureau; 62 21 3983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Costas Paris [ 08-07-05 1014GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050708e178000yv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
