 \highlight\uc2  and continuing domestic corporate demand for dollars will weigh on the rupiah.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar will likely trade between IDR9,770 to IDR9,800 on Monday, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 - By Phelim Kyne; Dow Jones Newswires' Jakarta Bureau; 62 21 3983 1277; phelim.kyne@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Costas Paris  \par \par \uc2 -0-  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020050708e178006by\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
