\par\par \b \uc2 RPT-Indonesian rupiah near 8-week low on oil,  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  rules  \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2005\par 04:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Repeats to fix headline)  \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, June 21 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah traded on Tuesday near an eight-week low hit overnight as record high oil prices and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to curb offshore speculation led local oil importers and offshore investors to buy dollars.  \par \par \uc2 The rupiah <IDR=> traded near 9,660 per dollar, its lowest level since April 27. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had hit a three-year low of 9,800 on April 26.  \par \par \uc2 U.S. benchmark light crude oil futures <CLc1> jumped to a record $59.52 per barrel on Monday raising import costs of Indonesia's main fuel importer, PT Pertamina, which seeks to boost imports to replenish inventory after solving a cash-crunch.  \par \par \uc2 "Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  which are particularly vulnerable to high oil prices are the baht and the rupiah," Irene Cheung, head of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at ABN AMRO Bank, said in a note.  \par \par \uc2 The baht <THB=> traded as low as 41.155 per dollar on Tuesday, near its 7-1/2-month low of 41.17 hit on Friday. The baht and the rupiah are Asia's worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year, after the Japanese yen <JPY=>.  \par \par \uc2 Indonesian state oil-and-gas company, Pertamina, said on Monday it was seeking a loan of between $500 million and $700 million to finance oil product imports.  \par \par \uc2 The company plans to increase its fuel stocks to equal 20 days of demand, from the current 17.5 days, Pertamina President Director Widya Purnama told reporters.  \par \par \uc2 Cheung said the rupiah has also seen selling pressure since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced plans last week to tighten \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading, including limiting certain derivative deals, from July 14 to stabilise the the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , also banned buying of rupiah-denominated securities issued by non-residents.  \par \par \uc2 "No doubt Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to resist with both \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and rate hikes of various sorts but a creeping increase in the (dollar-rupiah) pair is most likely," IDEAglobal Ltd. said in a note.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-INDONESIA-RUPIAH (REPEAT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL|IF|RNP|DNP|PTD|PEN|PMF  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050621e16l0004n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
