R9,600 Monday, with trading volume expected to be thinner due to the holiday in Singapore.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com [ 29-04-05 0952GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050429e14t000gi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
