\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Ends Higher On Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 April 2005\par 12:31\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah extended its recovery by another 1.2% Wednesday as Bank Indonesia reportedly sold dollars and sent auditors to foreign banks' dealing rooms in Jakarta to deter \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation, dealers said.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar closed at IDR9,573, down from its close Tuesday at IDR9,688. The rupiah had risen 0.6% Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively unloaded dollars via brokers to prop up the rupiah. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't be reached for comment, but its officials have said recently that the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the rupiah when necessary.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that Bank Indonesia also dispatched its auditors to look at foreign banks' transaction activity.  \par \par \uc2 "Suddenly, we saw a dollar selloff today from foreign banks, who likely unloaded their dollar long positions after central banks sent their auditors to those banks," a dealer with a local bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Foreign banks are the main players in Jakarta's interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers said that dollar demand from local companies also abated as they chose to wait on the sidelines, likely hoping to buy the greenback at lower levels.  \par \par \uc2 The market welcomed President Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono's call earlier Wednesday for his ministers to coordinate closely with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost the rupiah's value, which recently fell to over-three-year lows.  \par \par \uc2 "It shows that the president is in charge on this (rupiah weakness) problem," a dealer with a local bank said.  \par \par \uc2 Dealers expect the dollar to continue sliding Thursday. They, however, forecast a wide IDR9,500-IDR9,750 range as the market remains unstable.  \par \par \uc2 -By I Made Sentana; Dow Jones Newswires; 62-21 39831277; I-Made.Sentana@dowjones.com [ 27-04-05 1031GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 1159 1848  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050427e14r000n3\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (indonesia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt